  "recipeCuisine": "Thailand",
  "name": "Stir Fried Sesame Chicken",
  "text": "Stir Fried Sesame Chicken\n\nYield: 4\n\nPreparation time:\n\nCooking time:\n\nStatus: Bland.\n\nIngredients\n\n1 1/2 tbsp sesame seeds,\n\n1 tbsp vegetable oil,\n\n2 tbsp sesame oil,\n\n1 dried red chilli (deseeded and crumbled),\n\n3 cloves garlic (sliced),\n\n400 g chicken breast (cut into small cubes),\n\n2 spring onions (cut into medium pieces),\n\n1 1/2 tbsp fish sauce.\n\nPreparation\n\n1. In a dry wok toast the sesame seeds until golden, then set aside.\n\n2. Add the oils to the wok and stir fry the chilli and garlic until lightly coloured.\n\n3. Add the chicken and spring onion, and stir fry for 2 minutes.\n\n4. Season with fish sauce and continue cooking over medium heat for another  minute until the chicken is done.\n\n5. Stir in the sesame seeds and serve.",
  "recipeYield": "4",
  "recipeIngredient": [
    "1 1/2 tbsp sesame seeds,",
    "1 tbsp vegetable oil,",
    "2 tbsp sesame oil,",
    "1 dried red chilli (deseeded and crumbled),",
    "3 cloves garlic (sliced),",
    "400 g chicken breast (cut into small cubes),",
    "2 spring onions (cut into medium pieces),",
    "1 1/2 tbsp fish sauce."
  ],
  "recipeInstructions": [
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "1. In a dry wok toast the sesame seeds until golden, then set aside."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "2. Add the oils to the wok and stir fry the chilli and garlic until lightly coloured."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "3. Add the chicken and spring onion, and stir fry for 2 minutes."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "4. Season with fish sauce and continue cooking over medium heat for another  minute until the chicken is done."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "5. Stir in the sesame seeds and serve."
    }
  ],
